[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C01_CROWN_IN_MUD]
Crown Covered in Mud

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C01_CROWN_IN_MUD_DESC]
The end of a desperate history, the doom of a lonely pony, the shackle of the confined nature, the repentance of the power carnival.
A new beginning.

[l_simp_chinese.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C01_CROWN_IN_MUD]
沾满污泥的皇冠

[l_simp_chinese.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C01_CROWN_IN_MUD_DESC]
一段疯狂历史的终结，一只孤独小马的末路，一条禁锢天性的枷锁，一场权力狂欢的忏悔。
一个新的开始。

